    <string name="blaze_update_changelog_headline">BlazeAOSP 17. Silky Smooth. Flow with AI.</string>
    <string name="blaze_update_changelog_p1">BlazeAOSP 17, a fresh new look.\n\nSmooth from the start, fluid over time. All-new Living Flow Design. Smooth in motion, vivid by nature.</string>
    <string name="blaze_update_changelog_p2">Laminar Flow Engine now features adaptive memory &amp; RenderThread spring scheduling to deliver sustained stability and silky-smooth performance in both the foreground and background.</string>
    <string name="blaze_update_changelog_p3">Unified Material 3 Expressive geometry, iOS 27 Dark Smoked Crystal lens surfaces, and Dynamic Island live timers &amp; messaging work in seamless harmony.</string>
    <string name="blaze_update_changelog_p4">Android 17 (API 37) • Official Release</string>
    <string name="blaze_update_changelog_p4_formatted">Security patch: %1$s • Kernel: %2$s\nBuild ID: %3$s • Verified by BlazeAOSP OTA</string>
